<title>USA: First Knox Banc raises quarterly dividend.</title>
<headline>First Knox Banc raises quarterly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNT VERNON, Ohio 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Knox Banc Corp said Tuesday its board increased the quarterly cash dividend to $0.17 per share from $0.143 in the year-ago quarter.</p>
<p>The company also said it would pay an additional $0.07 for the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>The $0.24 dividend will be payable to shareholders of record December 20 and distributed January 2, the company said.</p>
